Subject: [PATCH] Add OBS window grid capture (capture = obs)

Up to 10 OBS windows are arranged in a grid by the obs-moonlight-grid plugin and
streamed as one video through a GPU shared texture. Touch, click and drag on the
grid are sent to the matching real window.
